atom     containers/list-new-takes-elements
source   generated
gen      gen/containers.raku
law      List.new({X})  ===  ({X},)
why      List.new takes its arguments AS ELEMENTS, unlike Array.new
ladder   14 spellings

- id     0001
  from   law:list-new-takes-elements · bug:rakupp-list-new-flattened
  cell   1
  code   do { my %h = :a(1); my @a = 1, 2, 3; my $s = (1, 2, 3); List.new(1) }
  same-as do { my %h = :a(1); my @a = 1, 2, 3; my $s = (1, 2, 3); (1,) }

